{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3001_037nao", "source_sha256": "fe88e89e72fc67f18cf639ae5a748143c7fd4799bc862b2696ea5797af2551f4", "ja": "ああ～、どないしよ～！　最近レッスンが忙しくて、\nちっともお笑い研究してなかったわ……。", "zh": "啊啊～怎么办～！最近都忙着上训练课程，\n一点都没研究搞笑啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3002_p", "source_sha256": "852c5a78e5f4c3f82633234042723a8f7e0d9039905a3eba12b66b64f94f7f87", "ja": "どうした、奈緒？　何、騒いでるんだ？", "zh": "怎么了，奈绪？你在激动什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3003_037nao", "source_sha256": "26f57692f1558fc6b5cfba765b7ed3a15dd7324ece070c65a8dfb171d050d3ff", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　グッドタイミングや！\nちょっと私の話、聞いてください！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！你来得正好！\n请听我说一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3004_037nao", "source_sha256": "3c0410bfbbfbc96737ef046dacfc783d0d08aa6fe0f53197b381b1c37000cfbe", "ja": "今度、アイドル大喜利番組の収録がありますよね？\nせやのに、私……。", "zh": "我不是要录偶像搞笑机智问答节目吗？\n然而我却……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3005_p", "source_sha256": "c5cb15793402868e0928574adc6d037233782a0501095b8b2aaa5f3d89b45a8a", "ja": "なるほど……忙しくて、流行のお笑い番組や\n芸人さん達をチェックしていなかった、と。", "zh": "原来如此……你太忙碌了，\n没有去了解流行的搞笑节目和搞笑艺人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3006_037nao", "source_sha256": "8344afb30be67aae5e766f63b5285ae72d7ca886e57cfd16aa1c51dd012f1d6f", "ja": "うう……はい。今からやっても、もう間に合わへんし。\n……私、どうしたらいいんやろ？", "zh": "呜呜……是的，现在开始也来不及了呀。\n……我该怎么办才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3007", "source_sha256": "c927a5c50e2632380977bf176d7bf7ded768d3ef46cbdfcd5646d570fe066bc9", "ja": "DVDで研究", "zh": "看DVD研究", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
