{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3100_p", "source_sha256": "56cf32f972958e2e3001dd39599ab0247bb50e36f012e839a980868c5dc50e97", "ja": "いや、まだ間に合う。今からDVDで研究しよう！", "zh": "不，还来得及，现在开始看DVD研究吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3101_037nao", "source_sha256": "7c579e1c892041d974159a6e2723628fb2093582c47598e3ee07dd49d1a485fe", "ja": "DVDで研究……せや！　その手があったわ！\nまだ時間はあるし、とにかくやってみます！", "zh": "看DVD研究……对吼！还有这招！\n现在还有时间，总之我先试试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3102_037nao", "source_sha256": "49eab21a7a4eb1d2777d01d3ec1105b472f4d9abac1d0d9969907264dc6b9656", "ja": "{$P$}さんも付き合ってください！\n私のためやと思って、頼みます～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，请你陪我一起练！\n就当作是为了我，拜托了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3200_p", "source_sha256": "56cf32f972958e2e3001dd39599ab0247bb50e36f012e839a980868c5dc50e97", "ja": "いや、まだ間に合う。今からDVDで研究しよう！", "zh": "不，还来得及，现在开始看DVD研究吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3201_037nao", "source_sha256": "a6ad738b734007ea5068c65c0ca1b844f2322a64cb52f6064d75245d146cb4dc", "ja": "おおっ、いいアイディアやな！　今ならまだ\nレンタルショップもあいてるし……私、行ってきます！", "zh": "喔喔，真是个好主意！现在影音出租店\n应该还开着……我出门了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3202_p", "source_sha256": "1a46905c0f3dceea18217408cfae0ae13b75e2cd7fb41c1a513fe7f2e2efc1e2", "ja": "あっ、おい、奈緒……！", "zh": "啊，喂，奈绪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3203_037nao", "source_sha256": "10e0229d0b15e7075ee866d5dfce4b736f66a1db03792da512c90953ff27ad01", "ja": "ああっ、肝心なこと聞き忘れたわ！　どのDVDで研究\nすればええんや……{$P$}さ～ん！", "zh": "啊啊，忘记问重点了！要看哪片DVD\n来研究才好啊……{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3300_p", "source_sha256": "a3fb2414fc3e89283de19d500a6ed3bfca01555e9b58a63533209d9867331f15", "ja": "そうか……わかった、奈緒。\n俺にツッコめ！", "zh": "这样啊……我知道了，奈绪。\n吐槽我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3301_037nao", "source_sha256": "0e50c9a6d3ab5e1457672f3434b340b7a21320f829718ea6da6713ba63c05b56", "ja": "おおっ、なるほど！　早速ツッコ……って、なんで\n{$P$}さんにツッコまなあかんねん！", "zh": "喔喔，原来如此！那就赶紧吐槽……为什么\n一定要吐槽{$P$}先生啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3302_037nao", "source_sha256": "adf7ff940a4bc6746bb1f12c997e684cd06387f38b3f5e7ac654c640f5fe8289", "ja": "逆やん、逆！　{$P$}さんが、\n私のボケにツッコんでくださいよ～！", "zh": "反了、反了！{$P$}先生，\n应该是我来装傻，请你吐槽啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3400_p", "source_sha256": "a3fb2414fc3e89283de19d500a6ed3bfca01555e9b58a63533209d9867331f15", "ja": "そうか……わかった、奈緒。\n俺にツッコめ！", "zh": "这样啊……我知道了，奈绪。\n吐槽我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3401_037nao", "source_sha256": "50ab8bc5d44b464780249a83e1a5ca91be8174f783da684489179e906693137e", "ja": "おおっ、なるほど！　実践で鍛えるっちゅう話ですね！\nほな、さっそく……。", "zh": "喔喔，原来如此！透过实战来锻炼的意思吧！\n那就赶紧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_3402_037nao", "source_sha256": "6c09384f708965e981a84657b5a820ac3c4ad78e2ea34afeaa0bfc04573d7f04", "ja": "って、そもそも大喜利で必要なんは、\nツッコミちゃうわー！", "zh": "等一下，搞笑机智问答需要的\n根本就不是吐槽啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
